# Backend API URL for Mozz Printer Agent Electron Main Process
# Production default: https://www.starters4u.in
# Local development: http://localhost:3000
MOZZ_API_URL=https://www.starters4u.in
STARTERS4U_API_URL=https://www.starters4u.in

# NOTE: Device tokens are strictly protected and NEVER exposed in Vite renderer variables or .env files.
# Device tokens are acquired via /api/print-agent/register-device or /api/print-agent/devices/pair
# and stored securely via OS-level safeStorage in Electron AppData.
